### Requiere rol: director
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/usuarios
    ?page=0
    &size=10
    &sortBy=id
    &direction=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### GET ALL - Filtrar por username
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/usuarios
    ?username=mmartinez
    &page=0
    &size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### GET ALL - Filtrar por email
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/usuarios
    ?email=juan.perez@timescope.es
    &page=0
    &size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### GET ALL - Filtrar por isDeleted
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/usuarios
    ?isDeleted=false
    &page=0
    &size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### GET ALL - Filtrar por username e isDeleted
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/usuarios
    ?username=alopez
    &isDeleted=false
    &page=0
    &size=10
    &sortBy=id
    &direction=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### GET - Obtener mi propio perfil (isAuthenticated)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/usuarios/me
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### PATCH - Asignar rol (DIRECTOR → cualquier rol; LIDER → solo LIDER)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/usuarios/1/asingRol?role=LIDER
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}